{"campaign_version":"storage-taxonomy-v2-20260813","canonical":{"bri_country":"No","category":"储能","country":"日本","country_iso":"JPN","created_at":"2026-03-23T09:54:05.149751","excluded":0,"excluded_reason":null,"id":"JPN-ES-0003","ldc":"No","location":"千叶县","location_norm":null,"name_en_quality":"ai_translated","project_name":"日本千叶县2MW/8MWh储能项目","project_name_en":"Chiba Prefecture 2MW/8MWh BESS Project","subcategory":null},"events":[{"articles":[{"author":"正泰电源","content":"在日本电力市场化改革的浪潮下，工商业储能正从单一的\"削峰填谷\"工具，升级为兼具电力交易收益和电网辅助服务价值的多元资产。正泰电源深度把握这一趋势，为日本客户量身打造\"买卖电+电网调频\"的复合型储能解决方案，让储能系统在参与JEPX（日本电力交易所）峰谷套利的同时，还能通过提供电网辅助服务获取额外收益。\n采用正泰电源工商业储能系统的千叶2MW/8MWh项目就是“买卖电+电网辅助服务”应用场景下的深度体现。依托日本电力交易市场（JEPX）的峰谷价差机制，该项目采用高压并网的方式，通过行业领先的分散式功率转换系统（PCS）架构，结合深度定制化的本土化设计策略，精准匹配日本市场应用场景需求，助力客户构建高效稳定的能源管理系统，实现储能资产效益与投资回报率的双重突破。\n单系统独立运行，避免局部故障影响整体收益；通过集成高防护等级变压器与智能并网控制器，来降低施工配线成本约30%；为了进一步提升系统的灵活性和收益能力，该系统\n采用All-in-One一体化设计\n，在出厂前完成预装和调试，大幅缩短了现场安装时间。此外，\n该系统具备簇级管理功能\n，能实现每簇电池满充满放，有效解决传统并联方案下SOC不一致的问题。还可按客户需求配置2MW/4MWh、2.4MW/5MWh、2MW/8MWh、2.4MW/10MWh等多种储能方案。\n在运维方面，正泰电源通过远程监控和预测性维护技术，显著降低了人工巡检频率，有效应对了日本高昂的人工成本挑战。\n系统全年可用率高达98%以上\n，确保客户能够稳定参与JEPX电力交易，持续获取峰谷价差收益。","content_sha256":"c97ee94ec38694c7c6f1880b0494837a30695a8813de48fb4d75f9c253ec2e9c","id":4122,"publish_date":"2025-04-09 17:16:50","title":"深度布局日本，正泰电源助力千叶县储能项目成功并网","title_sha256":"f8b2b64b695a812508f1001d2e5733b9176a59ab778c3710111c32dc45f8572e","url":"https://news.goalfore.cn/topstories/detail/81186.html"}],"event":{"additional_remarks":"","canonical_id":"JPN-ES-0003","capacity_details":"BESS: 2MW/8MWh","capacity_mw":2.0,"capacity_mw_raw":"2","capacity_source":"legacy","contract_amount_usd":null,"contract_amount_usd_raw":null,"created_at":"2026-03-23T09:54:05.150247","financing_amount_usd":null,"financing_amount_usd_raw":null,"financing_model":"Unknown","financing_model_details":"","id":"JPN-ES-0003-01","investment_date":"","line_length_km":null,"needs_manual_review":0,"non_official_website_links":"[]","official_website_links":"[\"https://www.chintpower.com/news/detail/id/10601.html\"]","planned_complete_date":"","planned_start_date":"","production_capacity_unit":null,"production_capacity_value":null,"project_developer":"Unknown","project_developer_en":null,"project_stage":"投入运营","project_summary":"正泰电源在日本千叶县提供工商业储能解决方案，该项目装机容量为2MW/8MWh，旨在参与电力交易和提供电网调频服务，目前已成功并网。","publish_date":"2025-04-09 17:16:50","pv_capacity_mw":null,"source_links":"[\"https://news.goalfore.cn/topstories/detail/81186.html\"]","storage_energy_mwh":8.0,"storage_power_mw":2.0,"total_investment_usd":null,"total_investment_usd_raw":"","transmission_capacity_mw":null,"verification_confidence":null,"verification_sources":null,"verification_status":"unverified","voltage_kv":null}}],"evidence_policy":{"exact_quote_required":true,"quote_must_not_cross_surfaces":true,"valid_surfaces":["title","body"]},"project_id":"JPN-ES-0003","schema_version":"storage-taxonomy-evidence-package-v1","selection_reasons":["existing_storage_numeric","storage_text_signal"]}
